@startuml Redis集群数据迁移示例
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Redis集群数据迁移过程

' 定义参与者
participant "客户端" as Client
participant "源节点\n(哈希槽5000-6000)" as SourceNode
participant "目标节点\n(接收哈希槽5000-6000)" as TargetNode
participant "其他集群节点" as OtherNodes

' 迁移前状态
note over SourceNode, TargetNode
  **迁移前状态**
  源节点: 负责哈希槽5000-6000
  目标节点: 未负责哈希槽5000-6000
  键"user:1001"的哈希值映射到槽5678
end note

' 迁移过程
== 1. 迁移准备 ==
SourceNode -> TargetNode: CLUSTER SETSLOT 5678 IMPORTING <源节点ID>
TargetNode --> SourceNode: OK
SourceNode -> SourceNode: CLUSTER SETSLOT 5678 MIGRATING <目标节点ID>
SourceNode -> OtherNodes: 广播槽位状态变更
OtherNodes --> SourceNode: 确认

== 2. 数据迁移 ==
SourceNode -> SourceNode: 识别槽5678中的所有键
SourceNode -> TargetNode: MIGRATE <目标IP> <目标端口> "" 0 5000 KEYS "user:1001" ...
note right: 使用MIGRATE命令原子性地迁移键
TargetNode --> SourceNode: OK

== 3. 处理迁移过程中的请求 ==
Client -> SourceNode: GET user:1001
alt 键已迁移
  SourceNode --> Client: ASK <槽> <目标节点地址>
  Client -> TargetNode: ASKING\nGET user:1001
  TargetNode --> Client: <值>
else 键未迁移
  SourceNode -> SourceNode: 本地处理请求
  SourceNode --> Client: <值>
end

== 4. 完成迁移 ==
SourceNode -> SourceNode: 确认槽5678的所有键已迁移
SourceNode -> TargetNode: CLUSTER SETSLOT 5678 NODE <目标节点ID>
TargetNode -> TargetNode: 接管槽5678
TargetNode -> OtherNodes: 广播槽位分配变更
OtherNodes --> TargetNode: 确认

' 迁移后状态
note over SourceNode, TargetNode
  **迁移后状态**
  源节点: 不再负责哈希槽5678
  目标节点: 现在负责哈希槽5678
  键"user:1001"现在存储在目标节点
end note

== 5. 客户端路由更新 ==
Client -> SourceNode: GET user:1001
SourceNode --> Client: MOVED <槽> <目标节点地址>
Client -> TargetNode: GET user:1001
TargetNode --> Client: <值>
Client -> Client: 更新本地路由表

@enduml
